; hark: root-hints = 127.0.10.1
; hark: dnssec-zone = .
; hark: dnssec-zone = example.

SCENARIO_BEGIN secure two-zone delegation chain validates end to end

; The first scenario in this suite with more than one signed zone. Until the
; harness learned to emit a DS, every DNSSEC scenario was root-only, so hark's
; whole chain-walking apparatus — fetchDsFromParent, validateDnskeyAgainstDs,
; classifyDelegation, reproveDelegationSecurity — had no end-to-end coverage
; at all. That gap is why a bug as plain as "ask the child for its own DS"
; (3abd644) survived to be found by diff-rolling instead of by the suite.
;
; `DS PLACEHOLDER` is substituted by the responder with the real
; digest of example.'s generated key: a .rpl record is static text and cannot
; spell a digest that does not exist until run time.
;
; Topology
;   root     127.0.10.1   delegates example. with a DS, signs the DS as `.`
;   example  127.0.10.2   apex, signs its own data as `example.`
;
; Expected: hark validates `. DNSKEY` against the trust anchor, fetches the DS
; for example. FROM THE ROOT, validates example.'s DNSKEY against it, then
; validates the leaf. AD=1.

RANGE_BEGIN 0 100
  ADDRESS 127.0.10.1

  ; Secure referral. The NS travels unsigned (RFC 4035 §2.2); the DS does not.
  ENTRY_BEGIN
    MATCH opcode subdomain
    ADJUST copy_id copy_query
    REPLY QR NOERROR
    SECTION QUESTION
      example. IN A
    SECTION AUTHORITY
      example. 3600 IN NS ns.example.
      example. 3600 IN DS PLACEHOLDER
    SECTION ADDITIONAL
      ns.example. 3600 IN A 127.0.10.2
  ENTRY_END
RANGE_END

RANGE_BEGIN 0 100
  ADDRESS 127.0.10.2

  ENTRY_BEGIN
    MATCH opcode qname qtype
    ADJUST copy_id copy_query
    REPLY QR AA NOERROR
    SECTION QUESTION
      www.example. IN A
    SECTION ANSWER
      www.example. 3600 IN A 192.0.2.1
  ENTRY_END
RANGE_END

STEP 1 QUERY
ENTRY_BEGIN
  REPLY RD DO
  SECTION QUESTION
    www.example. IN A
ENTRY_END

STEP 2 CHECK_ANSWER
ENTRY_BEGIN
  MATCH flags answer question
  REPLY QR RD RA AD NOERROR
  SECTION QUESTION
    www.example. IN A
  SECTION ANSWER
    www.example. 3600 IN A 192.0.2.1
ENTRY_END

SCENARIO_END
